__wjZ9i"><div class="ContentElements_o-content-elements__kfxh_"><div class="ContentElements_o-content-element__eDyor"><div><div class="HtmlText_a-html-text__ueoUZ"><p>In 2027 zijn er wijzigingen in het Gemeenschappelijk landbouwbeleid. Bekijk alvast wat u kunt verwachten.</p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="rvo-card rvo-card--with-image rvo-card--with-image-md rvo-card--outline rvo-card--padding--xl" id="008902a4-d076-4a07-a83d-892fd045a0ec" data-testid="block-008902a4-d076-4a07-a83d-892fd045a0ec"><div class="rvo-card__image-container"><div class="Image_a-image__wrapper__9ULUC
      
      
       Image_a-image__wrapper--fill-aspect-ratio-3-2__pSftB"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="Image_a-image__BdZu_ Image_a-image--rounded-top__ObqV6" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, (max-width: 1280px) 25vw, 300px" srcSet="/files/file/styles/3_2_300w/public/2025-02/Hoofspanningsstation%20Hengelo-1920.jpg.webp?h=06f6671c&amp;itok=TXXcGopy 160w, /files/file/styles/3_2_300w/public/2025-02/Hoofspanningsstation%20Hengelo-1920.jpg.webp?h=06f6671c&amp;itok=TXXcGopy 300w, /files/file/styles/3_2_600w/public/2025-02/Hoofspanningsstation%20Hengelo-1920.jpg.webp?h=06f6671c&amp;itok=EMNvyXfp 600w, /files/file/styles/3_2_960w/public/2025-02/Hoofspanningsstation%20Hengelo-1920.jpg.webp?h=06f6671c&amp;itok=hzUkAuUU 960w, /files/file/styles/3_2_1200w/public/2025-02/Hoofspanningsstation%20Hengelo-1920.jpg.webp?h=06f6671c&amp;itok=hh9PtnlJ 1200w, /files/file/styles/3_2_1920w/public/2025-02/Hoofspanningsstation%20Hengelo-1920.jpg.webp?h=06f6671c&amp;itok=8zH3msVx 1920w, /files/file/styles/3_2_2400w/public/2025-02/Hoofspanningsstation%20Hengelo-1920.jpg.webp?h=06f6671c&amp;itok=zVCNHz9l 2400w" src="/files/file/styles/3_2_2400w/public/2025-02/Hoofspanningsstation%20Hengelo-1920.jpg.webp?h=06f6671c&amp;itok=zVCNHz9l"/><div class="Copyright_rvo-theme-copyright-details__Mtx9A" data-testid="copyright-container"><div class="Copyright_rvo-theme-copyright-details__inner__z0qHy"><button class="Copyright_rvo-theme-copyright-details__trigger__sqdl3" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Copyright tonen" data-testid="copyright-trigger"><span aria-hidden="true">©</span><span class="sr-only">Copyrightinformatie</span></button><div class="Copyright_rvo-theme-copyright-details__body__ebHx2" aria-hidden="true"><span class="Copyright_rvo-theme-copyright-details__text__vI6hl">Chris Pennarts</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="rvo-card__content"><h3 class="utrecht-heading-3 rvo-heading rvo-heading--margin-3 rvo-heading--gap-xs"><div class="rvo-heading__content"><a class="rvo-link rvo-card__link rvo-card__full-card-link rvo-link--no-underline" href="/onderwerpen/netcongestie">Netcongestie: wat betekent dit voor u?</a></div></h3><div class="Block_o-block-content__wjZ9i"><div class="ContentElements_o-content-elements__kfxh_"><div class="ContentElements_o-content-element__eDyor"><div><div class="HtmlText_a-html-text__ueoUZ"><p>De druk op het elektriciteitsnet neemt toe. Dit kan gevolgen hebben voor uw bedrijfsactiviteiten of plannen. Ontdek welke mogelijkheden er zijn en hoe u zich kunt voorbereiden.</p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="rvo-card rvo-card--with-image rvo-card--with-image-md rvo-card--outline rvo-card--padding--xl" id="de3a6139-85a2-437b-ad09-d41047a029fc" data-testid="block-de3a6139-85a2-437b-ad09-d41047a029fc"><div class="rvo-card__image-container"><div class="Image_a-image__wrapper__9ULUC
      
      
       Image_a-image__wrapper--fill-aspect-ratio-3-2__pSftB"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="Image_a-image__BdZu_ Image_a-image--rounded-top__ObqV6" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, (max-width: 1280px) 25vw, 300px" srcSet="/files/file/styles/3_2_300w/public/2026-05/20260422_EW.png.webp?h=c3635fa2&amp;itok=_kuPinzU 160w, /files/file/styles/3_2_300w/public/2026-05/20260422_EW.png.webp?h=c3635fa2&amp;itok=_kuPinzU 300w, /files/file/styles/3_2_600w/public/2026-05/20260422_EW.png.webp?h=c3635fa2&amp;itok=rn34yt-f 600w, /files/file/styles/3_2_960w/public/2026-05/20260422_EW.png.webp?h=c3635fa2&amp;itok=pUD7ZUgY 960w, /files/file/styles/3_2_1200w/public/2026-05/20260422_EW.png.webp?h=c3635fa2&amp;itok=mNau_cMU 1200w, /files/file/styles/3_2_1920w/public/2026-05/20260422_EW.png.webp?h=c3635fa2&amp;itok=etNt44_L 1920w, /files/file/styles/3_2_2400w/public/2026-05/20260422_EW.png.webp?h=c3635fa2&amp;itok=H1peMn3T 2400w" src="/files/file/styles/3_2_2400w/public/2026-05/20260422_EW.png.webp?h=c3635fa2&amp;itok=H1peMn3T"/></div></div><div class="rvo-card__content"><h3 class="utrecht-heading-3 rvo-heading rvo-heading--margin-3 rvo-heading--gap-xs"><div class="rvo-heading__content"><a class="rvo-link rvo-card__link rvo-card__full-card-link rvo-link--no-underline" href="/onderwerpen/veilig-en-weerbaar-internationaal-ondernemen">Veilig en weerbaar internationaal ondernemen</a></div></h3><div class="Block_o-block-content__wjZ9i"><div class="ContentElements_o-content-elements__kfxh_"><div class="ContentElements_o-content-element__eDyor"><div><div class="HtmlText_a-html-text__ueoUZ"><div class="ContentElements_o-content-element__yvTUF">
<div>
<div class="HtmlText_a-html-text__jJ8f4">
<div class="ContentElements_o-content-element__yvTUF">
<div>
<div class="HtmlText_a-html-text__jJ8f4">
<p>Ken en verklein de risico&#x27;s van internationaal ondernemen. Lees onze informatie over veilig en weerbaar zakendoen in het buitenland of met internationale partijen.</p>
</div>
</div>
